# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# VERCEL ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES — Paste into Vercel Dashboard
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# Go to: https://vercel.com/dashboard → provance → Settings → Environment Variables
# Add each variable below. Set scope to: Production, Preview, Development
#
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# ── Supabase ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
SUPABASE_URL
https://YOUR-SUPABASE-PROJECT.supabase.co
──────────────
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
YOUR-SUPABASE-ANON-KEY
──────────────
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY
YOUR-SUPABASE-SERVICE-ROLE-KEY
──────────────
SUPABASE_JWKS_URL
https://YOUR-SUPABASE-PROJECT.supabase.co/auth/v1/.well-known/jwks.json
──────────────
SUPABASE_AUTH_REDIRECT_URL
https://provanc3.vercel.app/sign-in
──────────────
SUPABASE_WAITLIST_TABLE
waitlist_applications
──────────────
#
# ── Backend API ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ⚠️  Replace YOUR-FLY-APP with your actual Fly.io app name
#     Find it at: https://fly.io/dashboard → your app → App Name
VITE_API_BASE_URL
https://provance-api.fly.dev/v1
──────────────
#
# ── Mock mode OFF for production ──────────────────────────────────────────────
VITE_USE_MOCK
false
──────────────
#
# ── Frontend origin ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
FRONTEND_ORIGIN
https://provanc3.vercel.app
──────────────
#
# ── Sentry error tracking (frontend) ─────────────────────────────────────────
# This is the FRONTEND DSN — different from the backend DSN
VITE_SENTRY_DSN
YOUR-SENTRY-DSN
──────────────
#
# ── Unsplash (optional — for sample images) ──────────────────────────────────
# ⚠️  Previous key ran out of space — use sparingly or leave empty
VITE_UNSPLASH_ACCESS_KEY
(empty — leave blank until needed)
──────────────
